de cada uno a trav\u00e9s de cabellos tan elocuentes.<\/p>\n<p>Ser uno mismo, afirmarse, atreverse. Frente al conformismo y a los prejuicios, Jean Louis David da rienda suelta a una pluralidad de identidades y estilos.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><\/div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->\n<div  class='flex_column av-454rs-714188336c2244baaa9a6719eb9c7650 av_one_third  avia-builder-el-6  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_third  first flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyxqzcsr-e20a899f4e4c5cd68c2c030a65b771de\">\n.avia-image-container.av-lyxqzcsr-e20a899f4e4c5cd68c2c030a65b771de img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-lyxqzcsr-e20a899f4e4c5cd68c2c030a65b771de .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-lyxqzcsr-e20a899f4e4c5cd68c2c030a65b771de av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-7  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-29 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-29 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/JEAN-LOUIS-DAVID-SS24-1.png\" alt='' title='Jean Louis David Colecci\u00f3n Primavera Verano 2024'  height=\"1350\" width=\"1080\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/JEAN-LOUIS-DAVID-SS24-1.png 1080w, https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/JEAN-LOUIS-DAVID-SS24-1-240x300.png 240w, https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/JEAN-LOUIS-DAVID-SS24-1-824x1030.png 824w, https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/JEAN-LOUIS-DAVID-SS24-1-768x960.png 768w, https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/JEAN-LOUIS-DAVID-SS24-1-564x705.png 564w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" \/><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyxqznzk-994386fd1761a69e3256d61dfb61b38e '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p><strong>CORTE:\u00a0<\/strong>Carr\u00e9 desestructurado y un flequillo ligeramente por encima de las cejas. Para aportarle volumen y personalidad, basta con un poco de espuma en las ra\u00edces y un toque maestro con el cepillo redondo<\/p>\n<p><strong>COLOR:\u00a0<\/strong>Resultado natural hecho a medida gracias al 2 en 1 Jean Louis David, un m\u00e9todo de coloraci\u00f3n que realza el brillo y asegura un difuminado perfecto.<\/p>\n<p><strong>PEINADO:\u00a0<\/strong>El carr\u00e9 se alisa y se vuelve minimalista con el trabajo realizado con la plancha. Para proteger el cabello y aumentar el brillo, se aplica el Spray Thermoprotect Jean Louis David previamente sobre el cabello seco<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n<div  class='flex_column av-3chzg-d16f90ce3cef90efdaf80269b566ef69 av_one_third  avia-builder-el-9  el_after_av_one_third  el_before_av_one_third  flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyxr09xf-cb7195d411747041d124bd7809a87d03\">\n.avia-image-container.av-lyxr09xf-cb7195d411747041d124bd7809a87d03 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-lyxr09xf-cb7195d411747041d124bd7809a87d03 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-lyxr09xf-cb7195d411747041d124bd7809a87d03 av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-10  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"